  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab><hi rend="allcaps">The Tenth Night Of</hi><lb/>
               <persName ref="namedentities.xml#jo_br">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Braham</hi>'s</persName> Engagement.<lb/>
               <placeName ref="namedentities.xml#lyceum"><hi rend="allcaps"><hi rend="italic">Theatre Royal, Lyceum.</hi></hi></placeName><lb/>
               This present <hi rend="allcaps">Friday</hi>, <date when="1812-05-22"><hi rend="allcaps">May</hi> 22, 1812</date>,<lb/>
               Their Majesties Servants will perform a Comic Opera in 3 Acts, called<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_cabinet">The <hi rend="allcaps">Cabinet</hi>.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Prince Orlando,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_br">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Braham</hi>,</actor><lb/>
                  (Being his only appearance in that Character this Season.)</castItem><lb/> 
                  <castItem><role>Count Curvoso,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Penley</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>The Marquis,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_ox">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Oxberry</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Lorenzo,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ed_ho">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Horn</hi></actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Whimsiculo,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Knight</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Peter,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_do">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Dowton</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Manikin,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_br_fi">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Fisher</hi></actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Falconers,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Miller</hi>,</actor> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Lee</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Constantia,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Poole</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Leonora,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">L. Kelly</hi></actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Dorilice,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ti">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Tidswell</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Crudelia,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#an_sc">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Scott</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Bianca,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#sa_sp">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Sparks</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Curiosa,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#sa_ha">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Harlowe</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Floretta,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_di">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Dickons</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               After which (<hi rend="italic">Second Time</hi>) an entirely New Farce, called<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_how_to_die_for_love">How to Die For Love!</title></bibl>
               The Songs incidental to the Piece, composed by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#ch_sm">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">C. Smith</hi></persName>.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head>The Characters by</head><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Penson</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#be_wr">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Wrench</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#vi_de">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Knight</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_ox">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Oxberry,</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#wa_ma">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Maddocks</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Kelly</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               Boxes and Places to be taken of Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Spring</hi>, Box Office, Strand Entrance<lb/>
               from <time when="10:00:00"><hi rend="allcaps">Ten</hi></time> till <time when="16:00:00"><hi rend="allcaps">Four</hi></time>, &amp; of whom may be had <hi rend="allcaps">Private Boxes</hi> Nightly.<lb/>
               Boxes <measure type="currency">6s.</measure> Second Price <measure type="currency">3s</measure>. Pit <measure type="currency">3s. 6d</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">2s</measure>. Gallery <measure type="currency">2s</measure>.<lb/>
               Second Price <measure type="currency">1s</measure>. Upper Gallery <measure type="currency">1s</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">6d</measure>.<lb/>
               The Doors to be Opened at <time when="17:30:00">Half-Past Five</time>, and to commence at <time when="18:30:00">Half-past Six</time>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">Vivant Rex et Regina!-No Money to be Returned</hi></ab> 
         </div>
      </body>
